OL,3,GNEWSATeen rape victim 'lost part of    
OL,4,Amyself' in attack                      
OL,6,FA teenage girl who was abducted from a 
OL,7,Fpark and raped told a court she had    
OL,8,F"lost part of myself" and hates being  
OL,9,Fout at night.                          
OL,11,FJay Savage, 33, grabbed the girl and   
OL,12,Fthreatened to stab her after he        
OL,13,Ffollowed her into a dark area of       
OL,14,FCentral Park in Boston, Lincolnshire,  
OL,15,Fin March.                              
OL,17,FLincoln Crown Court was told Savage was
OL,18,Fseen on CCTV marching the girl to his  
OL,19,Fhotel, where he filmed himself sexually
OL,20,Fassaulting her.                        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
