OL,3,GNEWSATeen rape victim 'lost part of    
OL,4,Amyself' in attack                      
OL,6,FOn Friday, Savage was jailed for 15    
OL,7,Fyears. He must also serve an extra five
OL,8,Fyears on licence following his release 
OL,9,Ffrom prison, after a judge ruled he was
OL,10,Fa "dangerous offender".                
